      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WRITE touches: APIM, Create Service, Cosmos write region\n(async to read regions); clicks: Redirect Service ->\nEvent Hubs -> aggregator -> Stats container.\n\nREAD touches: Front Door, Redirect Service, Redis,\nnearest Cosmos read region (miss), write region only\nwhen a brand-new code is not replicated yet.\nNever cache a 404.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WRITE touches: APIM, Create Service, Cosmos write region\n(async to read regions); clicks: Redirect Service ->\nEvent Hubs -> aggregator -> Stats container.\n\nREAD touches: Front Door, Redirect Service, Redis,\nnearest Cosmos read region (miss), write region only\nwhen a brand-new code is not replicated yet.\nNever cache a 404.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
