      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WRITE touches: Front Door logs -> Event Hubs -> aggregator\n-> Stats container (clicks); delete = APIM -> Create Service\n-> Cosmos + Front Door purge + Redis DEL.\n\nREAD touches: Front Door cache (most clicks), then\nRedirect Service in-process cache -> Redis -> Cosmos.\nThe origin sees ~1 request per edge POP per minute.",
